"Good. Let me read."

"As you like," she grumbles.

}
She leaves me to my notes and wanders toward Flower.

When the others shoulder gear, I tuck the book away and strap my pack tight.

"Brace yourselves," Daren calls out. "The wind is picking up fast. Stick close, watch the canopy, and keep clear of leaning trunks."

